cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below, and also cite the upstream HOPPY kit."
title: "HOPPY redesign: MuJoCo simulation and physical implementation"
abstract: >-
  A one-legged hopping robot on a rotating boom, redesigned from the HOPPY
  educational kit. Includes three MuJoCo models that share a hybrid 1 kHz
  controller (validated against the original MATLAB simulator), a mechanical
  redesign with a bird-type four-bar leg and 3D-printed parts, and C2000
  firmware that achieves autonomous continuous hopping.
